---
pagination: { data: languages, size: 1, alias: lang }
permalink: "{{ '/' if lang == 'en' else '/es/' }}orientation/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: orientation
titleKey: nav.orientation
descKey: orientation.meta_desc
bodyClass: o101-hub
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/orientation.js", "/assets/js/presentations-core.js", "/assets/js/presentations.js"]
---
{#- /orientation/ — "GVR / RLV 101", the orientation for new GVRs and RLVs (Panel 77 starts in January
    2027), and the committee's presentations (three workshops and its monthly meeting). Wording: "sessions" led
    by a "facilitator", never lessons, trainers or a course (AA shares experience; see config/orientation.yml).
    The sessions live in config/orientation.yml (src/_data/orientation.js → `orientation.lessons`); each one has
    its own page (orientation-lesson.njk). The presentations live in config/presentations/<id>.yml
    (src/_data/presentations.js → `presentations.decks`, one card each; their slides are
    /orientation/presentations/<id>.json).
    The page, top to bottom (each part once — the "On this page" chips in the welcome card jump to them; the
    owner's order, 2026-10-02: the sessions' own slides right after the sessions):
      hero (both: the sessions and the presentations) → welcome + progress (page-overlap) + "On this page"
      → #sessions (#lessons: its older address) the six session cards
      → one tinted band, "Present":
          #present        the six sessions as slides + the printable handout
          #presentations  "Presentations" (not "workshop presentations": one of them is a meeting): a card per
                          presentation (Present · Customize · More, and Print in its four modes), "Reset all 4 to
                          the original" right under the cards (shown once this device has changed one), then
                          "Print or save a copy" — no decks: the section is left out
          #presenting     "How presenting works", a CLOSED <details> at the end of the band, for BOTH slide shows:
                          a line for touch screens, the keys, and with presentations the presenter view, versions,
                          your details, privacy, saving, offline and reset (opened by a link to it) — no button
                          inside: a closed box hid "Reset all", which the player says is under the presentations
      → #facilitators (#trainers: its older address) the 45-minute district plan, and the 90-minute
        Orientation Workshop presentation for a longer one → #next.
    Not on screen:
      #o101-deck-tpl  the sessions' slide show (a <template>): orientation.js clones it into a full-screen dialog
                      on "Present as slides" or at /orientation/?slides (#slide-N resumes, #session-<id> — or the
                      older #lesson-<id> — starts a session). Fixed high-contrast palette (areas/orientation.css).
      .o101-handout   the printable handout (display: none on screen; printing this page prints it): one Letter
                      sheet per session.
      pres.player()   the presentations' player (macros/presentations.njk, src/assets/js/presentations.js — the
                      pop-up, Customize, the presenter view, printing a presentation).
    The player's hooks on this page (its script finds them; without JavaScript they are hidden — data-js-only —
    and each card shows its PowerPoint copy instead, data-nojs-only):
      a[data-pres-open="<id>"][href="?present=<id>"]        Present; Customize and Presenter view add
                                                            data-pres-mode="customize" | "presenter" AND the same
                                                            &mode=… in the address (a new tab opens in that mode)
      button[data-pres-print="<id>"][data-pres-print-mode]  slides | notes | handout | script; the "Print or save a
                                                            copy" card's one button has both EMPTY: the player then
                                                            reads the card's fields named "deck" and "mode" (it is a
                                                            [data-pres-print-form]) — no Alpine needed to print
      [data-pres-status="<id>"]                             empty: the script writes "Changed on this device: … ·
                                                            Last shown: slide 12 of 48 · Resume" (one line of text)
      button[data-pres-reset="<id>"], [data-pres-reset="all"]   hidden until there is something to reset (the
                                                            card's in its More menu; "all" under the cards)
    Progress ("sessions done on this device") is kept by orientation.js in localStorage only; a presenter's own
    version of a presentation by presentations.js (localStorage too) — nothing is sent anywhere. -#}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{% import "macros/orientation.njk" as o with context %}
{% import "macros/presentations.njk" as pres with context %}
{%- set O = orientation -%}
{%- set V = O | o101Vars(lang, site.meeting | cmRule(lang), site.meeting | cmTimeRange(lang)) -%}
{%- set total = O.lessons | length -%}
{%- set hubAbs = ('/orientation/' | lurl(lang)) | siteUrl(site) -%}
{%- set tones = ["bg-gv-soft text-gv", "bg-vine-soft text-vine", "bg-lv-soft text-lv", "bg-grape-soft text-grape", "bg-gv-soft text-gv", "bg-vine-soft text-vine"] -%}
{%- set half = ((total + 1) / 2) | round(0, "floor") -%}
{%- set firstHalf = O.lessons | limit(half) -%}
{%- set secondHalf = O.lessons | offset(half) -%}
{%- set welcomeMin = 3 -%}{%- set closeMin = 3 -%}
{#- The committee's presentations (none: their parts are left out, and the page is the sessions' page as before) -#}
{%- set decks = presentations.decks if (presentations and presentations.decks) else [] -%}
{%- set nDecks = decks | length -%}
{%- set toneCls = { gv: "bg-gv-soft text-gv", lv: "bg-lv-soft text-lv", vine: "bg-vine-soft text-vine", grape: "bg-grape-soft text-grape" } -%}
{%- set modes = ["slides", "notes", "handout", "script"] -%}
{#- a version label's "(about 48 minutes)" at its end, and the names that start with a capital in any sentence (a
    card's "Also:" line, below) -#}
{%- set lengthRe = r/\s*\((?:about|unos|unas)\s[^()]*\)\s*$/ -%}
{%- set namesRe = r/^(?:Grapevine|La Viña|AA|Zoom|NETA)\b/ -%}
{%- set driveItems = db.drive.items if (db and db.drive and db.drive.items) else [] -%}
{#- Each deck's PowerPoint copy: the newest file in the committee's Drive whose title is the deck's drive_title (as
    the deck's JSON finds it: eleventy/filters/presentations.js driveCopy) — a fixed copy, dated: it never updates.
    Used by the card's More menu, the card without JavaScript and "Print or save a copy" without JavaScript. -#}
{%- set copies = [] -%}
{%- for d in decks %}
  {%- set hits = [] -%}
  {%- for it in driveItems %}{% if it and it.source == "drive" and it.status != "gone" and d.drive_title and ((it.title or "") | replace(r/\s+/g, " ") | trim) == d.drive_title %}{% set _x = hits.push(it) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
  {%- if hits.length %}
  {%- set c = hits | sort(true, false, "date") | first -%}
  {%- set cUrl = (c.extra.view_url if (c.extra and c.extra.view_url) else c.url) | extUrl -%}
  {%- if cUrl %}{% set _x = copies.push({ id: d.id, url: cUrl, month: (c.date | fmtDate(lang, "month")) if c.date else "" }) %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

{#- The hero's right-hand card (the shared hero aside): "Your progress" — the sessions done on this device
    (the same [data-o101-progress] box orientation.js fills) and the six sessions as numbered dots (each a
    [data-o101-card], so it gets its check mark; they link to the sessions) + "All sessions" → #sessions.
    It MOVES there from the welcome card: while the card is in the hero (≥1024px at 100 % text)
    orientation.css hides the welcome card's own progress box; elsewhere the aside is hidden ("hide")
    and the welcome card keeps it.
    The actions: the sessions (start / continue), the presentations (#presentations) and the sessions' slide
    show — the third one from 768px, and not at 1024–1279px where the text column beside the card is narrow
    (orientation.css). Without presentations: start, the slide show and the handout, as before. -#}
{% call(slot) ui.pageHero(lang, "nav.orientation" | t(lang), ("orientation.hero_sub_pres" if nDecks else "orientation.hero_sub") | t(lang), "sprout", "orientation.eyebrow" | t(lang), { side: "hide" }) %}
{%- if slot == "side" %}
  {%- if total %}
  {% call ui.heroAside("orientation.hero_title" | t(lang), lang, { id: "o101-aside-title", icon: "list-checks", href: "#sessions", linkLabel: "orientation.hero_link" | t(lang), class: "o101-aside" }) %}
    <div data-o101-progress data-total="{{ total }}" data-t="{{ 'orientation.progress' | t(lang) }}" data-t-all="{{ 'orientation.progress_all' | t(lang) }}">
      <p class="hero-aside-title" data-o101-count>{{ "orientation.progress" | t(lang, { n: 0, total: total }) }}</p>
      <ol class="o101-dots" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'orientation.hero_dots' | t(lang) }}">
        {%- for l in O.lessons %}
        <li><a class="o101-dot" href="{{ ('/orientation/' + l.id + '/') | lurl(lang) }}" data-o101-card="{{ l.id }}" data-n="{{ l.n }}" title="{{ 'orientation.hero_dot' | t(lang, { n: l.n, title: (l.title | o101Text(lang)) }) }}"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ l.n }}</span><span class="o101-dot-check" data-o101-done hidden>{% icon "check", "size-3" %}</span><span class="sr-only">{{ "orientation.hero_dot" | t(lang, { n: l.n, title: (l.title | o101Text(lang)) }) }}<span data-o101-done-sr hidden> ({{ "orientation.done" | t(lang) }})</span></span></a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ol>
      <p class="hero-aside-note flex items-start gap-1.5">{% icon "lock", "mt-0.5 size-3 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.hero_saved" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      <button type="button" class="hero-aside-cta mt-2" data-o101-reset hidden>{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.progress_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </div>
  {% endcall %}
  {%- endif %}
{%- else %}
<div class="hero-actions">
  {%- if total %}
  <a class="btn-light" href="{{ ('/orientation/' + O.lessons[0].id + '/') | lurl(lang) }}" data-o101-resume data-t-continue="{{ 'orientation.continue' | t(lang) }}" data-t-review="{{ 'orientation.review' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "play", "size-4" %} <span data-o101-resume-label>{{ "orientation.start" | t(lang) }}</span></a>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if nDecks %}
  {#- phones: the short label ("Presentations"), so both buttons share one line and the hero keeps its height -#}
  <a class="btn-on-dark" href="#presentations">{% icon "presentation", "size-4" %} <span class="sm:hidden" aria-hidden="true">{{ "orientation.nav_pres" | t(lang) }}</span><span class="max-sm:sr-only">{{ "orientation.hero_pres" | t(lang) }}</span></a>
  {%- if total %}
  <a class="btn-on-dark o101-hero-third max-md:hidden" href="?slides" data-o101-present data-js-only>{% icon "monitor-play", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.hero_present" | t(lang) }}</a>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- elif total %}
  <a class="btn-on-dark" href="?slides" data-o101-present data-js-only>{% icon "presentation", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.present" | t(lang) }}</a>
  <button type="button" class="btn-on-dark o101-hero-third max-md:hidden" data-o101-print data-js-only>{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.handout_btn" | t(lang) }}</button>
  {%- endif %}
</div>
{{ ui.heroStats([
  { value: total, label: "orientation.stat_lessons" | t(lang) },
  { value: O.totalMinutes, label: "orientation.stat_minutes" | t(lang) },
  { value: O.totalChecks, label: "orientation.stat_checks" | t(lang) },
  { value: nDecks or null, label: "orientation.stat_pres" | t(lang) }
]) }}
{%- endif %}
{% endcall %}

{#- ---------- Welcome (page-overlap) + progress on this device + "On this page" ---------- -#}
<section class="container-page page-overlap" aria-labelledby="o101-welcome-title">
  <div class="card card-pad o101-welcome">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2 text-vine">{% icon "calendar-days", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.welcome_eyebrow" | t(lang, { panel: V.panel, start: V.panel_start }) }}</span></p>
      <h2 id="o101-welcome-title" class="h-section mt-2 text-balance">{{ "orientation.welcome_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "orientation.welcome_text" | t(lang, { min: O.totalMinutes }) }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="o101-progress" data-js-only data-o101-progress data-total="{{ total }}" data-t="{{ 'orientation.progress' | t(lang) }}" data-t-all="{{ 'orientation.progress_all' | t(lang) }}">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ "orientation.progress_label" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <div class="o101-bar mt-2" role="progressbar" aria-label="{{ 'orientation.progress_label' | t(lang) }}" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="{{ total }}" aria-valuenow="0"><span data-o101-bar style="width:0%"></span></div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink" data-o101-count>{{ "orientation.progress" | t(lang, { n: 0, total: total }) }}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{% icon "lock", "mt-0.5 size-3 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.saved_note" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm -mx-2 mt-1 text-muted" data-o101-reset hidden>{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.progress_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </div>
    {#- The page's parts, as ui.pageNav's chips (one row that scrolls sideways on phones, wraps from 1024px) —
        inside this card, the page's one block under the hero. A chip reached with Tab scrolls the row so it is
        wholly in view, clear of the row's 2rem fades (the browser's own scrolling left the third chip under the
        right fade): Alpine here, with the row's scroll-padding in areas/orientation.css. -#}
    <nav class="o101-onpage" aria-label="{{ 'common.on_this_page' | t(lang) }}">
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "list", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "common.on_this_page" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      <ul class="chip-row mt-2" role="list" x-data @focusin="$event.target.scrollIntoView({ block: 'nearest', inline: 'nearest' })">
        <li><a class="chip" href="#sessions">{% icon "list-checks", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "orientation.lessons_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}</a></li>
        <li><a class="chip" href="#present">{% icon "monitor-play", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "orientation.nav_present" | t(lang) }}</a></li>
        {%- if nDecks %}
        <li><a class="chip" href="#presentations">{% icon "presentation", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "orientation.nav_pres" | t(lang) }}</a></li>
        {%- endif %}
        <li><a class="chip" href="#facilitators">{% icon "users", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "orientation.trainers_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}</a></li>
        <li><a class="chip" href="#next">{% icon "compass", "size-4 shrink-0" %}{{ "common.next_steps" | t(lang) }}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ---------- The sessions (#lessons: the older address of this section, kept working) ---------- -#}
<section id="sessions" class="section container-page pt-10 sm:pt-12" aria-labelledby="sessions-title">
  <span id="lessons" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  {{ ui.sectionHead("orientation.lessons_title" | t(lang), "orientation.lessons_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "list-checks", { eyebrow: "orientation.lessons_eyebrow" | t(lang), id: "sessions-title", lang: lang }) }}
  <ol class="grid-cards-fit [--cards-min:15rem] [--cards-max:3] min-[1800px]:[--cards-max:6]" role="list">
    {% for l in O.lessons %}
    {%- set url = ('/orientation/' + l.id + '/') | lurl(lang) -%}
    <li class="card card-link group relative flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6" data-o101-card="{{ l.id }}" data-n="{{ l.n }}">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
        <span class="grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl {{ tones[loop.index0 % 6] }}">{% icon l.icon, "size-5" %}</span>
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ "orientation.lesson_n" | t(lang, { n: l.n }) }}</span>
        <span class="badge-muted ml-auto">{% icon "clock", "size-3" %} {{ "orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: l.minutes }) }}</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="h-card mt-4 text-balance"><a class="no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[var(--radius-card)] hover:text-gv" href="{{ url }}">{{ l.title | o101Text(lang) }}<span class="sr-only" data-o101-done-sr hidden> ({{ "orientation.done" | t(lang) }})</span></a></h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ l.summary | o101Text(lang) }}</p>
      <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-4">
        <span class="badge-vine" data-o101-done hidden>{% icon "circle-check", "size-3" %} {{ "orientation.done" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gv" aria-hidden="true"><span data-o101-cta data-t-review="{{ 'orientation.review_lesson' | t(lang) }}">{{ "orientation.start_lesson" | t(lang) }}</span> {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5" %}</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

{#- ---------- "How presenting works": ONE box for both slide shows, at the end of the "Present" band — a CLOSED
    <details> (the owner's decision, 2026-10-02: open, it was about 1,300px on a phone, a third of it keys a phone
    has no use for). Inside: touch screens first, the keys, and with presentations what to know about them. A link
    to #presenting opens it (Alpine: on load, on a hash change and on a click of a [data-o101-how] link — the same
    hash twice is no hash change); without JavaScript it stays a box to open by hand. ---------- -#}
{%- set howBox %}
<details id="presenting" class="card o101-how group/how" x-data
         x-init="if (location.hash === '#presenting') $el.open = true"
         @hashchange.window="if (location.hash === '#presenting') $el.open = true"
         @click.window="if ($event.target.closest?.('[data-o101-how]')) $el.open = true">
  <summary class="o101-how-sum">
    <span class="o101-how-tile" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "lightbulb", "size-5" %}</span>
    <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
      <h2 id="presenting-title" class="o101-how-h">{{ "orientation.pres_how_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
      <span class="o101-how-what">{{ ("orientation.pres_how_sub" if nDecks else "orientation.pres_how_sub_101") | t(lang) }}</span>
    </span>
    {% icon "chevron-down", "o101-how-chev size-5 shrink-0" %}
  </summary>
  <div class="o101-how-body">
    <p class="o101-how-touch">{% icon "hand", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.slides_touch" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
    <div class="o101-how-keys rounded-xl bg-surface-2 p-4">
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2">{% icon "keyboard", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.keys_title" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      <dl class="o101-keys mt-3">
        <div><dt><kbd>→</kbd> <kbd>{{ "orientation.kbd_space" | t(lang) }}</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_next" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>←</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_prev" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>{{ "orientation.kbd_home" | t(lang) }}</kbd> <kbd>{{ "orientation.kbd_end" | t(lang) }}</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_ends" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        {%- if nDecks %}
        <div><dt><kbd>12</kbd> <kbd>{{ "orientation.kbd_enter" | t(lang) }}</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_goto" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>N</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_notes" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>O</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_overview" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>C</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_customize" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>P</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_presenter" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>B</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_black" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        {%- endif %}
        <div><dt><kbd>F</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_full" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt><dd>{{ "orientation.key_exit" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      {%- if nDecks %}
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "orientation.pres_keys_101" | t(lang) }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {%- if nDecks %}
    {%- set how = [
      { icon: "monitor", t: "orientation.pres_presenter" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_presenter" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "layers", t: "orientation.pres_how_versions_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_versions" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "user-round-pen", t: "orientation.pres_how_details_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_details" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "lock", t: "orientation.pres_how_private_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_private" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "save", t: "orientation.pres_how_save_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_save" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "wifi-off", t: "orientation.pres_how_offline_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_offline" | t(lang) },
      { icon: "rotate-ccw", t: "orientation.pres_how_reset_t" | t(lang), d: "orientation.pres_how_reset" | t(lang, { n: nDecks }) }
    ] %}
    <ul class="o101-how-list" role="list">
      {%- for h in how %}
      <li>
        <span class="o101-how-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon h.icon, "size-4" %}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{{ h.t }}</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ h.d }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</details>
{%- endset %}

{#- ================= Present: the sessions as slides + the handout, then the committee's presentations, then
    "How presenting works" for both (one tinted band; two sections, so every card title is an h3 under its
    section's h2, and the closed how-to with its own h2). The band's last part keeps the band's bottom padding;
    the section before it leaves a card gap. ================= -#}
<div class="section-band">
<section id="present" class="section container-page{{ ' pb-0' if nDecks else ' pb-5' }}" aria-labelledby="present-title">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("orientation.use_title" | t(lang), "orientation.use_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "monitor-play", { eyebrow: "orientation.use_eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-grape", id: "present-title", lang: lang }) }}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card card-pad flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-grape">{% icon "presentation", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "orientation.present" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "orientation.slides_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      {#- A miniature of a slide: the show's navy, gold and white (decorative) -#}
      <div class="o101-slide-mini mt-4" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="o101-slide-mini-eyebrow"></span>
        <span class="o101-slide-mini-title"></span>
        <span class="o101-slide-mini-point"><span></span><span></span></span>
        <span class="o101-slide-mini-point"><span></span><span class="w-3/5"></span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "orientation.slides_keys" | t(lang) }} <a class="link" href="#presenting" data-o101-how>{{ "orientation.pres_how_title" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-5">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="?slides" data-o101-present data-js-only>{% icon "presentation", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.present" | t(lang) }}</a>
        <p class="o101-nojs-only text-sm text-muted">{% icon "info", "size-4 inline -mt-0.5" %} {{ "orientation.slides_nojs" | t(lang) }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card card-pad flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-grape">{% icon "printer", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "orientation.handout" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "orientation.handout_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      {#- A miniature of one sheet: what each page holds -#}
      <div class="o101-sheet-mini mt-4" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="o101-sheet-mini-head"></span>
        <span class="o101-sheet-mini-title"></span>
        <span></span><span></span><span class="w-4/5"></span>
        <span class="o101-sheet-mini-cols"><span></span><span></span></span>
        <span class="o101-sheet-mini-qr"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-5">
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-o101-print data-js-only>{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.handout_btn" | t(lang) }}</button>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted">{{ "orientation.handout_note" | t(lang) }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if nDecks %}
<section id="presentations" class="section container-page pb-5" aria-labelledby="presentations-title">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("orientation.pres_title" | t(lang), "orientation.pres_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "presentation", { eyebrow: "orientation.pres_eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-grape", id: "presentations-title", lang: lang }) }}
  {#- Without JavaScript: said once here (each card keeps its PowerPoint copy, "Print or save a copy" lists them) -#}
  <p class="o101-pres-nojs-line" data-nojs-only>{% icon "info", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ ("orientation.pres_nojs_copies" if copies.length else "orientation.pres_nojs") | t(lang) }}</span></p>
  {#- One card per presentation: 1 column, 2 from 1024px, 4 from 1800px at 100 % text (orientation.css) -#}
  <ul class="o101-pres-grid" role="list">
    {%- for d in decks %}
    {%- set dTitle = d.card.title[lang] or d.card.title.en or d.title -%}
    {%- set m = d.minutes or 0 -%}
    {%- set dIcon = d.icon or "presentation" -%}
    {#- "About 60 minutes · 49 slides" (a long one in hours: "About 2 hours") + the other versions (below) -#}
    {%- set head = [] -%}
    {%- if m %}{% set _x = head.push(("orientation.pres_hours" | t(lang, { n: (m / 60) | round })) if (m >= 100 and ((m % 60) <= 10 or (m % 60) >= 50)) else ("orientation.pres_minutes" | t(lang, { n: m }))) %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if d.count %}{% set _x = head.push("orientation.pres_slides" | t(lang, { n: d.count })) %}{% endif -%}
    {#- "Also:" — the other versions by a short name, after a colon in lower case: the version's label without the
        "(about 48 minutes)" it ends with, which becomes "(48 min)" — or nothing when it is the full version's
        length ("A month with a topic of the month (about 60 minutes)" → "a month with a topic of the month").
        A name that starts with a capital for a reason (GVR…, Grapevine, La Viña, AA, Zoom) keeps it. -#}
    {%- set alts = [] -%}
    {%- for p in d.presets | offset(1) %}
      {%- set lbl = (p.label[lang] or p.label.en or "") | trim -%}
      {%- set alt = lbl | replace(lengthRe, "") -%}
      {%- if alt != lbl and p.minutes and p.minutes != m %}{% set alt = alt + " (" + ("orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: p.minutes })) + ")" %}{% endif -%}
      {%- if not (namesRe.test(alt) or alt.charAt(1) != alt.charAt(1).toLowerCase()) %}{% set alt = alt.charAt(0).toLowerCase() + alt.slice(1) %}{% endif -%}
      {%- if alt %}{% set _x = alts.push(alt) %}{% endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- set copy = (copies | where("id", d.id))[0] -%}
    {%- set copyUrl = copy.url if copy else "" -%}
    <li class="card o101-pres-card" id="pres-{{ d.id }}">
      <div class="o101-pres-head">
        <span class="grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl {{ toneCls[d.tone] or toneCls.gv }}" aria-hidden="true">{% icon dIcon, "size-5" %}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ head | join(" · ") }}</p>
          {%- if alts.length %}
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-muted">{{ "orientation.pres_also" | t(lang, { list: alts | join(" · ") }) }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        {%- if lang != "en" %}
        <span class="badge-muted">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %} {{ "orientation.pres_english" | t(lang) }}</span>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <h3 id="pres-{{ d.id }}-title" class="h-card mt-4 text-balance">{{ dTitle }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ d.card.summary[lang] or d.card.summary.en }}</p>
      <dl class="o101-pres-facts">
        <div>
          <dt>{{ "orientation.pres_for" | t(lang) }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ d.card.audience[lang] or d.card.audience.en }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- if d.kinds and d.kinds.length %}
        <div>
          <dt>{% icon "refresh-cw", "size-3.5 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.pres_current" | t(lang) }}</span></dt>
          <dd><ul class="o101-pres-kinds" role="list">{% for k in d.kinds %}<li class="badge-muted">{{ ("orientation.pres_kind_" + (k | replace("-", "_"))) | t(lang) }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></dd>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </dl>
      <div class="o101-pres-foot">
        {#- filled by the player: "Changed on this device … · Last shown: slide 12 of 48 · Resume" — one line of
            text that wraps as a sentence (empty: not shown) -#}
        <p class="o101-pres-status" data-pres-status="{{ d.id }}"></p>
        <div class="o101-pres-actions" data-js-only>
          <div class="o101-pres-main">
            <a class="btn-primary btn-sm" href="?present={{ d.id }}" data-pres-open="{{ d.id }}">{% icon "play", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_present" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ dTitle }}</span></a>
            <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="?present={{ d.id }}&amp;mode=customize" data-pres-open="{{ d.id }}" data-pres-mode="customize">{% icon "sliders-horizontal", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_customize" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ dTitle }}</span></a>
            {#- "More" (the site's <details> menu, committee.css .cm-menu): at the end of its row, opening to the left,
                so it stays inside the card. Alpine closes it on a click outside, Escape and once an item is chosen
                (focus back on its button — the player then returns there when it closes). -#}
            <details class="cm-menu o101-pres-more" x-data @click.outside="$el.open = false"
                     @keydown.escape="if ($el.open) { $event.preventDefault(); $event.stopPropagation(); $el.open = false; $el.querySelector('summary').focus(); }"
                     @click="const it = $event.target.closest('.cm-menu-panel > a, .cm-menu-panel > button'); if (it) { if (it.target) setTimeout(() => { $el.open = false; }, 0); else { $el.open = false; $el.querySelector('summary').focus(); } }">
              <summary class="btn-ghost btn-sm">{% icon "ellipsis", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_more" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ dTitle }}</span></summary>
              <div class="cm-menu-panel">
                <a href="?present={{ d.id }}&amp;mode=presenter" data-pres-open="{{ d.id }}" data-pres-mode="presenter">{% icon "monitor", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_presenter" | t(lang) }}</a>
                {%- if copyUrl %}
                {#- a fixed copy: its month and "doesn't update" under the name (the slides above stay current) -#}
                <a class="o101-pres-copy" href="{{ copyUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "file-down", "size-4" %}<span class="min-w-0"><span class="block">{{ "orientation.pres_copy" | t(lang) }}</span><span class="o101-pres-copy-note">{{ ("orientation.pres_copy_note" | t(lang, { month: copy.month })) if copy.month else ("orientation.pres_copy_fixed" | t(lang)) }}</span></span>{% icon "arrow-up-right", "ml-auto size-4" %}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>
                {%- endif %}
                <button type="button" data-pres-reset="{{ d.id }}" hidden>{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
          {#- Print, in plain sight (the owner: "export / print it like the 101"): the current version — the presenter's
              details and changes — in the four modes, straight from the page. The label on its own line, the four
              buttons 4 in a row, 2 × 2 or one under the other by the room the CARD gives them (never 3 + 1) -#}
          <div class="o101-pres-print" role="group" aria-labelledby="pres-{{ d.id }}-print">
            <span id="pres-{{ d.id }}-print" class="o101-pres-print-label">{% icon "printer", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ "orientation.pres_print" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ dTitle }}</span></span></span>
            <div class="o101-pres-print-btns">
              {%- for mode in modes %}
              <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" data-pres-print="{{ d.id }}" data-pres-print-mode="{{ mode }}" title="{{ ('orientation.pres_mode_' + mode + '_d') | t(lang) }}">{{ ("orientation.pres_mode_" + mode) | t(lang) }}</button>
              {%- endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {#- Without JavaScript: the PowerPoint copy, dated (the section says once why there is nothing else) -#}
        {%- if copyUrl %}
        <div class="o101-pres-nojs" data-nojs-only>
          <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ copyUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "file-down", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_copy" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ dTitle }} ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></a>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ ("orientation.pres_copy_note" | t(lang, { month: copy.month })) if copy.month else ("orientation.pres_copy_fixed" | t(lang)) }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {#- "Reset all 4 to the original": right under the cards, in plain sight (in the closed "How presenting works" it
      stayed out of view) — where the player's Customize → Save & share says it is. Hidden until this device has
      changed one of them (the player shows it and asks first, then offers Undo); a block of its own, at the start. -#}
  <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm o101-pres-resetall" data-pres-reset="all" data-js-only hidden>{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_reset_all" | t(lang, { n: nDecks }) }}</button>

  {#- "Print or save a copy" (like the sessions' "Printable handout" card). Its fields are named "deck" and "mode" in
      a [data-pres-print-form]: the Print button's two hooks are EMPTY, so the player prints what the fields say —
      nothing here needs Alpine (if it is late or blocked, the visitor's choice still prints), and the miniature
      follows the chosen mode in CSS (:has). Without JavaScript: no picker, one line and the PowerPoint copies. -#}
  <div class="card card-pad o101-pp mt-5" data-pres-print-form>
    <h3 id="pres-print-title" class="card-h"><span class="text-grape">{% icon "printer", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "orientation.pres_print_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
    <p class="o101-pp-intro mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" data-js-only>{{ "orientation.pres_print_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <div class="o101-pp-body" data-js-only>
      {#- A miniature of the printed page in the chosen mode (decorative) -#}
      <div class="o101-pp-mini" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="o101-pp-page is-slides"><span class="o101-pp-slide"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></span>
        <span class="o101-pp-page is-notes"><span class="o101-pp-slide"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line w-3/5"></span></span>
        <span class="o101-pp-page is-handout">{% for i in [1, 2, 3] %}<span class="o101-pp-row"><span class="o101-pp-slide"><span></span><span></span></span><span class="o101-pp-rules"></span></span>{% endfor %}</span>
        <span class="o101-pp-page is-script"><span class="o101-pp-head"></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line w-4/5"></span><span class="o101-pp-head"></span><span class="o101-pp-line"></span><span class="o101-pp-line w-2/3"></span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="o101-pp-form">
        <label for="pres-print-deck" class="o101-pp-label">{{ "orientation.pres_print_which" | t(lang) }}</label>
        <div class="o101-pp-select">
          {#- In English the short name ("Writing Workshop"): three titles start "Grapevine and La Viña…", which was
              all a 320px phone showed of them. The Spanish titles start with what tells them apart. -#}
          <select id="pres-print-deck" name="deck" class="input">
            {%- for d in decks %}
            <option value="{{ d.id }}">{{ (d.short or d.card.title.en or d.title) if lang == "en" else (d.card.title[lang] or d.card.title.en or d.title) }}</option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </select>
          {% icon "chevron-down", "o101-pp-chev size-4" %}
        </div>
        <fieldset class="o101-pp-modes">
          <legend class="o101-pp-label">{{ "orientation.pres_print_what" | t(lang) }}</legend>
          <div class="o101-pp-grid">
            {%- for mode in modes %}
            <label class="o101-pp-mode"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="{{ mode }}"{% if loop.first %} checked{% endif %}><span class="o101-pp-mode-t">{{ ("orientation.pres_mode_" + mode + "_t") | t(lang) }}</span><span class="o101-pp-mode-d">{{ ("orientation.pres_mode_" + mode + "_d") | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <button type="button" class="btn-primary mt-4" data-pres-print="" data-pres-print-mode="">{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "orientation.pres_print" | t(lang) }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-js-only>{{ "orientation.pres_print_note" | t(lang) }} {{ "orientation.pres_print_keep" | t(lang) }}</p>
    {#- Without JavaScript: one line, and the PowerPoint copies to print from (none: the line says it needs JavaScript) -#}
    <div class="o101-pp-nojs" data-nojs-only>
      <p class="flex items-start gap-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{% icon "info", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" %}<span>{{ ("orientation.pres_print_nojs_copies" if copies.length else "orientation.pres_print_nojs") | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      {%- if copies.length %}
      <ul class="o101-pp-copies" role="list">
        {%- for c in copies %}
        {%- set cd = (decks | where("id", c.id))[0] -%}
        <li><a class="o101-pp-copy" href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "file-down", "size-4 shrink-0" %}<span class="min-w-0"><span class="o101-pp-copy-t">{{ cd.card.title[lang] or cd.card.title.en or cd.title }}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "common.external" | t(lang) }})</span></span><span class="o101-pp-copy-note">{{ ("orientation.pres_copy_note" | t(lang, { month: c.month })) if c.month else ("orientation.pres_copy_fixed" | t(lang)) }}</span></span></a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

{#- "How presenting works" (closed): the band's last part, for both slide shows -#}
<div class="container-page pb-12 sm:pb-16">
  {{ howBox | safe }}
</div>
</div>

{#- ---------- For facilitators: a 45-minute district orientation (#trainers: its older address) ---------- -#}
{%- set sumA = firstHalf | sum("minutes") -%}
{%- set sumB = secondHalf | sum("minutes") -%}
<section id="facilitators" class="section container-page" aria-labelledby="facilitators-title">
  <span id="trainers" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  {{ ui.sectionHead("orientation.trainers_title" | t(lang, { n: welcomeMin + O.totalMinutes + closeMin }), "orientation.trainers_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "users", { eyebrow: "orientation.trainers_eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-vine", id: "facilitators-title", lang: lang }) }}
  {#- The plan: four steps in a row from 1280px (2 × 2 from 640px); then what to bring, full width -#}
  <div class="space-y-5">
    <div class="card card-pad">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-vine">{% icon "timer", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "orientation.plan_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <ol class="o101-plan mt-5" role="list">
        {%- set plan = [
          { t: "orientation.plan1_t" | t(lang), min: welcomeMin, text: "orientation.plan1" | t(lang) },
          { t: "orientation.plan_lessons" | t(lang, { a: 1, b: half }), min: sumA, text: "orientation.plan2" | t(lang) },
          { t: "orientation.plan_lessons" | t(lang, { a: half + 1, b: total }), min: sumB, text: "orientation.plan3" | t(lang) },
          { t: "orientation.plan4_t" | t(lang), min: closeMin, text: "orientation.plan4" | t(lang) }
        ] %}
        {% for p in plan %}
        <li>
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 font-semibold text-ink">{{ p.t }} <span class="badge-muted">{{ "orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: p.min }) }}</span></p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ p.text }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="card card-pad">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-vine">{% icon "list-checks", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "orientation.before_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <div class="o101-before mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,24rem)] lg:items-center 2xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,28rem)]">
        <ul class="o101-before-list grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink" role="list">
          {% for k in ["before1", "before2", "before3", "before4"] %}
          <li class="flex gap-2.5">{% icon "check", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-vine" %}<span class="min-w-0">{{ ("orientation." + k) | t(lang) }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p class="flex gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{% icon "shield-check", "mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-vine" %}<span>{{ "orientation.anon_note" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {#- A longer one: the Orientation Workshop presentation (its card above has everything) -#}
    {%- set ow = (decks | where("id", "orientation-workshop"))[0] -%}
    {%- if ow %}
    {%- set owShort = [] -%}
    {%- for p in ow.presets | offset(1) %}{% if p.minutes and ow.minutes and p.minutes < ow.minutes and (not owShort.length or p.minutes < owShort[0]) %}{% set _x = owShort.splice(0, 1, p.minutes) %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
    {%- set owTitle = ow.card.title[lang] or ow.card.title.en or ow.title -%}
    {%- set owIcon = ow.icon or "presentation" -%}
    <div class="card card-pad o101-fac-pres">
      <span class="grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl {{ toneCls[ow.tone] or toneCls.gv }}" aria-hidden="true">{% icon owIcon, "size-5" %}</span>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <h3 class="card-h">{{ "orientation.pres_fac_t" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ ("orientation.pres_fac" | t(lang, { title: owTitle, n: ow.minutes, m: owShort[0] })) if owShort.length else ("orientation.pres_fac_one" | t(lang, { title: owTitle, n: ow.minutes })) }}</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="#pres-{{ ow.id }}">{{ "orientation.pres_fac_link" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{#- ---------- Next steps (closing block) ---------- -#}
<section id="next" class="section container-page pt-0" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("orientation.next_title" | t(lang), "orientation.next_sub" | t(lang), "", "", "compass", { eyebrow: "common.next_steps" | t(lang), id: "next-title", lang: lang }) }}
  {{ ui.nextSteps([
    { href: ("/gvr/" | lurl(lang)) + "#steps", title: "nav.gvr" | t(lang), text: "orientation.ns_gvr" | t(lang), cta: "orientation.ns_gvr_cta" | t(lang), icon: "badge-check", tone: "vine" },
    { href: "/monthly/" | lurl(lang), title: "nav.monthly" | t(lang), text: "orientation.ns_monthly" | t(lang), cta: "orientation.ns_monthly_cta" | t(lang), icon: "calendar-heart", tone: "gv" },
    { href: ("/meetings/" | lurl(lang)) + "#committee-meeting", title: "orientation.ns_meeting_t" | t(lang), text: (site.meeting | cmRule(lang)) + " · " + (site.meeting | cmTimeRange(lang)) + " · " + (site.meeting.platform or "Zoom"), cta: "orientation.ns_meeting_cta" | t(lang, { platform: site.meeting.platform or "Zoom" }), icon: "video", tone: "grape" },
    { href: ("/contribute/" | lurl(lang)) + "#deadlines", title: "nav.contribute" | t(lang), text: "orientation.ns_contribute" | t(lang), cta: "orientation.ns_contribute_cta" | t(lang), icon: "pen-line", tone: "lv" }
  ], lang) }}
</section>

{#- ================= The slide show (cloned by orientation.js) ================= -#}
{%- set deck = O.lessons | o101Deck -%}
{%- set N = deck | length -%}
{%- set grapes %}<svg class="o101-s-art" viewBox="0 0 200 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M100 18c4 18 2 34-6 48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M104 40c18-16 42-18 60-8-14 16-38 20-60 8Z" fill="currentColor" opacity=".55"/><g fill="currentColor"><circle cx="82" cy="96" r="17"/><circle cx="116" cy="96" r="17"/><circle cx="66" cy="126" r="17"/><circle cx="100" cy="126" r="17"/><circle cx="134" cy="128" r="17"/><circle cx="82" cy="156" r="17"/><circle cx="116" cy="156" r="17"/><circle cx="100" cy="186" r="17"/></g></svg>{% endset -%}
<template id="o101-deck-tpl">
  <div class="o101-deck" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ 'orientation.deck_label' | t(lang) }}" tabindex="-1" data-o101-deck
       data-t-live="{{ 'orientation.deck_live' | t(lang) }}" data-t-full="{{ 'orientation.deck_full' | t(lang) }}" data-t-full-exit="{{ 'orientation.deck_full_exit' | t(lang) }}"
       data-t-show="{{ 'orientation.deck_show' | t(lang) }}" data-t-hide="{{ 'orientation.deck_hide' | t(lang) }}">
    <div class="o101-deck-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-o101-deck-bar></span></div>
    <div class="o101-deck-main" data-o101-stage-wrap>
      <div class="o101-stage" data-o101-stage>
        {% for s in deck %}
        {%- set i = loop.index -%}
        {%- set hid = "slide-" ~ i ~ "-h" -%}
        {%- set l = s.lesson -%}
        {%- set lessonOf = ("orientation.lesson_n_of" | t(lang, { n: l.n, total: total })) if l else "" -%}
        <section class="o101-slide o101-slide--{{ s.kind }}" id="slide-{{ i }}" data-o101-slide{% if s.kind == 'lesson' %} data-lesson="{{ l.id }}"{% endif %} aria-roledescription="{{ 'orientation.deck_slide' | t(lang) }}" aria-labelledby="{{ hid }}" hidden>
          {%- if s.kind == "title" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body o101-s-center">
            {{ grapes | safe }}
            <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ site | pick(lang, "committee") }}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-display">{{ "nav.orientation" | t(lang) }}</h2>
            <p class="o101-s-lead">{{ "orientation.hero_sub" | t(lang) }}</p>
            <p class="o101-s-meta">{{ "orientation.welcome_eyebrow" | t(lang, { panel: V.panel, start: V.panel_start }) }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "agenda" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body">
            <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ "orientation.deck_agenda_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-h">{{ "orientation.deck_agenda_title" | t(lang, { n: O.totalMinutes }) }}</h2>
            <ol class="o101-s-agenda" role="list">
              {% for a in O.lessons %}<li><span class="o101-s-n" aria-hidden="true">{{ a.n }}</span><span class="o101-s-agenda-t">{{ a.title | o101Text(lang) }}</span><span class="o101-s-min">{{ "orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: a.minutes }) }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
            </ol>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "lesson" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body o101-s-lesson">
            <span class="o101-s-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon l.icon, "size-full" %}</span>
            <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ lessonOf }} · {{ "orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: l.minutes }) }}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-display">{{ l.title | o101Text(lang) }}</h2>
            <p class="o101-s-goal"><span class="o101-s-goal-k">{{ "orientation.goal" | t(lang) }}</span> {{ l.goal | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "points" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body">
            <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ lessonOf }} · {{ "orientation.points_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}{% if s.parts > 1 %} ({{ "orientation.deck_part" | t(lang, { a: s.part, b: s.parts }) }}){% endif %}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-h">{{ l.title | o101Text(lang) }}</h2>
            <ol class="o101-s-points" role="list">
              {% for p in s.points %}<li><span class="o101-s-n" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.start + loop.index }}</span><div><h3>{{ p.title | o101Text(lang, V) }}</h3><p>{{ p.text | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p></div></li>{% endfor %}
            </ol>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "try" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body o101-s-split">
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ lessonOf }}</p>
              <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-h">{{ "orientation.try_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
              <p class="o101-s-text">{{ l.try | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
              <h3 class="o101-s-sub">{{ "orientation.discuss_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
              <p class="o101-s-text o101-s-quote">{{ l.discuss | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="o101-s-panel min-w-0">
              <h3 class="o101-s-sub">{{ "orientation.live_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
              {{ o.live(l.example, lang, "slide") }}
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "check" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body" data-o101-check>
            <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ lessonOf }} · {{ "orientation.deck_check" | t(lang, { n: s.qi + 1, total: l.check | length }) }}</p>
            <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-h">{{ s.q.q | o101Text(lang, V) }}</h2>
            <ol class="o101-s-opts" role="list">
              {% for op in s.q.options %}<li{% if loop.index == s.q.answer %} data-correct{% endif %}><span class="o101-s-letter" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index0 | o101Letter }}</span><span class="min-w-0">{{ op | o101Text(lang, V) }}</span>{% if loop.index == s.q.answer %}<span class="o101-s-ok" data-o101-ok hidden>{% icon "circle-check", "size-full" %}<span class="sr-only"> ({{ "orientation.deck_correct" | t(lang) }})</span></span>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ol>
            <div class="o101-s-reveal">
              <button type="button" class="o101-s-btn" data-o101-reveal aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="slide-{{ i }}-why">{% icon "eye", "size-[1.1em]" %}<span data-o101-reveal-label>{{ "orientation.deck_show" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
              <p id="slide-{{ i }}-why" class="o101-s-why" data-o101-why hidden>{{ s.q.why | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- elif s.kind == "close" %}
          <div class="o101-s-body o101-s-split o101-s-split--close">
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="o101-s-eyebrow">{{ "common.next_steps" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <h2 id="{{ hid }}" class="o101-s-display o101-s-display--sm">{{ "orientation.deck_close_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
              <ul class="o101-s-close" role="list">
                <li><strong>{{ "orientation.deck_close_register" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{% if lang == "es" %}aalavina.org · aagrapevine.org{% else %}aagrapevine.org · aalavina.org{% endif %}</span></li>
                <li><strong>{{ "orientation.deck_close_steps" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ (('/gvr/' | lurl(lang)) | siteUrl(site)) | replace("https://", "") }}</span></li>
                <li><strong>{{ "orientation.deck_close_meeting" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{% if meeting.next %}{{ meeting.next.start | fmtDate(lang, "long") }} · {% endif %}{{ site.meeting | cmTimeRange(lang) }} · Zoom</span></li>
                <li><strong>{{ "orientation.deck_close_monthly" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ (('/monthly/' | lurl(lang)) | siteUrl(site)) | replace("https://", "") }}</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <figure class="o101-s-qr">
              {{ hubAbs | qrSvg("orientation.qr_alt" | t(lang, { url: hubAbs }), "o101-s-qr-svg") | safe }}
              <figcaption><strong>{{ "orientation.deck_qr" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ (hubAbs | replace("https://", "") | escape | replace("/", "/<wbr>")) | safe }}</span></figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          {%- endif %}
        </section>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="o101-deck-bar">
      <button type="button" class="o101-deck-btn" data-o101-prev aria-label="{{ 'orientation.deck_prev' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "chevron-left", "size-5" %}</button>
      <p class="o101-deck-count" aria-hidden="true"><span data-o101-n>1</span> / {{ N }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="o101-deck-btn" data-o101-next aria-label="{{ 'orientation.deck_next' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "chevron-right", "size-5" %}</button>
      <span class="flex-1"></span>
      <button type="button" class="o101-deck-btn o101-deck-btn--text" data-o101-full>{% icon "maximize", "size-5" %}<span data-o101-full-label>{{ "orientation.deck_full" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="o101-deck-btn o101-deck-btn--text" data-o101-exit aria-label="{{ 'orientation.deck_exit_label' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "x", "size-5" %}<span>{{ "orientation.deck_exit" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
    </div>
    <p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-o101-live></p>
  </div>
</template>

{#- ================= The presentations' player (macros/presentations.njk: its dialog shell and words) ================= -#}
{%- if nDecks %}
{{ pres.player(lang) }}
{%- endif %}

{#- ================= The printable handout (print only: one sheet per session) ================= -#}
<div class="o101-handout">
  {% for l in O.lessons %}
  {%- set lessonAbs = (('/orientation/' + l.id + '/') | lurl(lang)) | siteUrl(site) -%}
  <article class="o101-sheet" aria-labelledby="sheet-{{ l.id }}">
    <header class="o101-sheet-head">
      <span>{{ "orientation.lesson_eyebrow" | t(lang, { n: l.n, total: total }) }} · {{ "orientation.minutes" | t(lang, { n: l.minutes }) }}</span>
      <span>{{ site | pick(lang, "committee") }}</span>
    </header>
    <h2 id="sheet-{{ l.id }}">{{ l.title | o101Text(lang) }}</h2>
    <p class="o101-sheet-goal"><strong>{{ "orientation.goal" | t(lang) }}:</strong> {{ l.goal | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
    <h3>{{ "orientation.points_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}</h3>
    <ol class="o101-sheet-points">
      {% for p in l.points %}<li><strong>{{ p.title | o101Text(lang, V) }}.</strong> {{ p.text | o101Text(lang, V) }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="o101-sheet-cols">
      <div>
        <h3>{{ "orientation.try_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p>{{ l.try | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
        <h3>{{ "orientation.discuss_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p><em>{{ l.discuss | o101Text(lang, V) }}</em></p>
        <h3>{{ "orientation.live_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {{ o.live(l.example, lang, "print") }}
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>{{ "orientation.check_eyebrow" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <ol class="o101-sheet-qs">
          {% for q in l.check %}
          <li><p>{{ q.q | o101Text(lang, V) }}</p>
            <ul>{% for op in q.options %}<li><span class="o101-sheet-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ loop.index0 | o101Letter }}. {{ op | o101Text(lang, V) }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
        {%- set ans = [] -%}{%- for q in l.check %}{% set _x = ans.push(loop.index ~ " " ~ ((q.answer - 1) | o101Letter)) %}{% endfor %}
        <p class="o101-sheet-answers">{{ "orientation.handout_answers" | t(lang, { list: ans | join(" · ") }) }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <footer class="o101-sheet-foot">
      <div>
        <h3>{{ "orientation.links_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <ul>
          {% for k in l.links | o101Links(lang, site) %}<li>{{ k.label }} — {{ (k.href if k.ext else (k.href | siteUrl(site))) | replace("https://", "") | replace("www.", "") }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure>
        {{ lessonAbs | qrSvg("", "o101-sheet-qr") | safe }}
        <figcaption>{{ "orientation.handout_qr" | t(lang) }}<br>{{ lessonAbs | replace("https://", "") }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </footer>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
